      "text": [
        "290 - وَقَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «غَسْلُ اَلرَّأْسِ بِالْخِطْمِيِّ فِي كُلِّ جُمُعَةٍ ' أَمَانٌ مِنَ اَلْبَرَصِ وَ اَلْجُنُونِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.290 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"Washing the head with Al-khatmi (a type of herbal shampoo or a plant known as marshmallow root) every Jumu’ah provides protection from vitiligo and insanity.\""
        ]
      }
